questions.solution:
\Delta T_f = K_f \cdot m = K_f \cdot \frac{w_B / M_B}{w_A / 1000}
0.40 = K_f \cdot \frac{1 / 256}{50 / 1000} = K_f \cdot \frac{1000}{256 \times 50} = K_f \cdot \frac{20}{256}
K_f = \frac{0.40 \times 256}{20} = 5.12\text{ K kg mol}^{-1}.

